{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"admission-preemption","content_sha256":"sha256:a1b81ba419dc48ee1b7636073aa23234faa503043863cd97b35e50d028d529c7","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789924928.864823,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"KV 不足时调度器抢占：swap（换 CPU）或 recompute（丢弃重算）低优先序列，避免 OOM，代价是被抢占请求延迟上升；抢占次数是重要健康指标。","id":"q-inference-admission-preemption-002","options":[{"id":"a","text":"触发抢占：把部分序列的 KV 换出(swap 到 CPU)或直接丢弃后重算(recompute)，腾出块给高优先/可继续的序列；恢复时再换回或重新 prefill。这保证不 OOM，但被抢占序列会有额外延迟"},{"id":"b","text":"直接崩溃并返回 OOM"},{"id":"c","text":"把模型权重换出显存"},{"id":"d","text":"无限增大 KV cache"}],"prompt":"当 KV cache 显存不足以容纳所有在跑序列时，vLLM 一类调度器会怎么办？","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"reliability","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM (PagedAttention/scheduler)","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"scheduling","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
